  "summary": "libsignal dependency pinned to unpinned third-party GitHub fork",
  "details": "package.json declares `\"libsignal\": \"github:RahmadTenpoles/libsignal-node\"` with no tag or commit SHA. On `npm install`, this resolves to whatever the default branch of that third-party GitHub account currently returns and executes any lifecycle scripts in the fetched tarball on the installer's machine. The fetched contents can change at any time without any version bump of raiden-baileys, and the referenced account is not the recognized upstream maintainer of libsignal-node forks used by the Baileys ecosystem.",
